/**
 * API reference: which API is published in which documentation.
 *
 * The pages of each API are generated from its spec (openapi/) by
 * `pnpm gen-api` in <docs>/api/reference/<api>/, inside the OnPrem docs of a
 * version, the Cloud docs or the Log Management docs, and are listed in the
 * API category of their sidebar (an "autogenerated" item, see
 * apiSidebarItemsGenerator below). The specs come from the product
 * repositories: openapi/sources.yaml and `pnpm api:sync`.
 *
 * Read by docusaurus.config.js (plugin docusaurus-plugin-openapi-docs and
 * sidebars) and by generate.mjs.
 */
